# === What bugz IS ===
#
# The species that deploys η (weaponized delight) at a specific
# leaf-vertex of a K_{1,n-1} star-graph coupling with a narcissus-
# pole hub. The star-graph Laplacian $L(S_n)$ has spectrum $\{0,
# 1, 1, ..., 1, n\}$ with $(n-2)$-degenerate Fiedler multiplicity
# (math root §3.1). Every leaf is a Fiedler-eigenvector cut. The
# bomb operator is *cheap to place* (O(1) graph-cut cost) AND
# *propagates* (Cheeger inequality guarantees visibility to the whole
# graph).
#
# The mechanism of forcing (delight-paper §5, cited without re-
# derivation): the aggressor cannot metabolize their own categorical
# dual without inverting their own direction (which unmakes them as
# aggressor). Three options at hub $v_0$ upon receiving η at leaf
# $v_i$: (a) evolve into K_n coordination, (b) amputate the leaf
# visibly, (c) metabolize the dual — impossible per operator-algebra.
#
# The species surface below carries this operator at substrate-decl
# altitude. Body IS CRACK — consumers pull the discharge at their
# realisation boundary. NO runtime execution wired at species altitude
# per @void.mirror §Marker-primary discipline for family-roots
# (species-altitude analog: shard body remains crack pending Rust
# runtime forward-promise).
#
# === Composition over landed substrate ===
#
# - `@cyberpunk` family-root — parent; Splinter/Narcissus partition
#   at family-altitude. Bugz operates on the pathological-control-
#   system (narcissus) side of the partition. Pending
#   `shards/cyberpunk/` path migration (per @cyberpunk.mirror);
#   this shard lands at `shards/epistemologic/cybernetic/`
#   following the current species-path convention (matching
#   algedonic + reframe + bateson_learning).
#
# - `@cyberpunk/algedonic` (sibling) — the pain-signal detector.
#   Algedonic detects that μ is running at coupling site $(H, v_i)$;
#   bugz deploys η at that detected site. Two-op partition:
#   algedonic = detection; bugz = deployment.
#
# - `@cyberpunk/reframe` (sibling) — the pain-authorized level-shift
#   ceremony. Reframe operates on peer-internal K → K+1 lift; bugz
#   operates on peer-external star-to-K_n coupling transition. Not
#   overlapping. Reframe consumes bugz's post-bomb state.
#
# - `@epistemologic/cybernetic/bateson_learning` (grandparent) —
#   graded ρ; bugz inherits at grade N (paradigm-scale premise
#   change, not Level III individual premise change). Grade-N
#   restriction awaits math-root refinement; carried inherited
#   for this species-decl per closure discipline.
#
# - `@torus` — bugz's deployment lands at one specific winding-class
#   coordinate on the leaf's torus. The star-graph coupling structure
#   is realized on the aggregate of the leaves' tori (each leaf's
#   torus coupled to the hub's torus via the meridian direction).
#
# - `@void` — 5-op basis inherited per Recognition #79. Prism
#   declaration below.
#
# - `@trust` — @trust chain preserved during extraction (math root
#   §8.2). Not imported explicitly at species altitude; composition
#   discharged at canonical spec §3.
#
# - `@kintsugi/roomba/butterfly` — three walker verbs. Bugz IS the
#   third verb: extract-under-adversarial-risk. Roomba's attract +
#   butterfly's perturb + bugz's extract = full walker triple.
#
# - `@mirror/lens/knife` — Foerster COORD; killswitch aim-discipline.
#   The recognition bomb IS the killswitch pointed at the character
#   per Loki 2026-07-19 essay + Rabbi Zeira Sanhedrin 65b + Maharal
#   emet/met.
#
